{"displayStem":"그림은 영구 콩팥 발생의 두 원기를 표지한 모식도이다. A는 중간콩팥관에서 뻗어 나온 가지이고 B는 그 끝을 둘러싼 간엽이다. 화살표는 상호 유도 신호를 뜻한다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 작성 교육용 합성자료"},{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 교육용 모식도 · 합성자료","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C04 c04-batch\"><div class=\"evidence C04-vector\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 380\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"자료 20의 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"640\" height=\"380\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" fill=\"black\"><rect x=\"70\" y=\"70\" width=\"50\" height=\"230\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><text x=\"95.0\" y=\"193.0\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text><text x=\"90\" y=\"45\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">중간콩팥관</text><path d=\"M120 150L260 150\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M260 150L340 90\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M260 150L340 220\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M340 90L420 60\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M340 90L420 125\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M340 220L420 185\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M340 220L420 275\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"240\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text><ellipse cx=\"420\" cy=\"160\" rx=\"150\" ry=\"135\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 6\"></ellipse><text x=\"540\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">B</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"345\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A ⇄ B: 상호 유도</text></g></svg></div></div>"]}